WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.900
Ready...

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.270
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.360
Ready...

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.780
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.820
Ready...

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.160
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.330
Ready...

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.620
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.750
Ready...

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:29.250
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.340
Ready...

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.010
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:09.440
Today's the day I wipe that cocky look off your face!

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:16.990
It's insulting that a worthless bum like yourself would even dare to stand before me.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.450
Little girl, I'll have you know...

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.950
That I... Um... Well...

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.410
Goddamn it!

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:42.010
Anyway... The usual girls' PE coach isn't here, so today's class will be co-ed.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:46.350
And since we're playing tennis today, why don't we pair up the boys with the girls?

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.680
<i>Doubles, eh?</i>

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:52.110
<i>So that means I have to pick a guy to team up with.</i>

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:52.690
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.320
<i>Come on, Ranmaru, say something!</i>

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.530
Ho... How...

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:01.910
Howsitgoin?!

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:04.240
What's up?

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:05.990
Um... Er...

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.080
Will you... Will you...

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.080
b-be my partner?

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:12.580
Sure!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.590
Let's go, Ranmaru!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:17.460
Oh, you!

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.510
Here, bring your waist in a bit.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:22.510
It started with a simple tennis match, but before we knew it...

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.510
we were doubles for life!

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:28.520
Oh my God! I can't believe this is how it all begins!!

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.640
H-Hey! What's gotten into you, Rindou?!

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.310
S-Sakura!

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.820
Would you be my partner?

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.110
Please, be mine!

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.740
No, be mine!

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:41.740
Hold it right there!

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:47.580
A pure maiden such as Sakura does not belong with commoners like yourselves!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.620
Who're you?

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:54.130
It is none other than the Prince of the Tennis Club, Adenokouji Shion, who stands before you.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.500
He really <i>is</i> a prince.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.210
Technically it's soft tennis, though.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:01.840
The only one pure enough for Sakura... is me.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.220
Would you be my princess?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.800
Sure, that's fine.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.140
Anyone's fine.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.560
Did she just wipe her hand?

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.310
What a bitch.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:18.190
She's terrible. And you boys are even worse!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.030
Cease your moaning.

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.490
Your jealousy will only feed her.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:28.990
We can settle our differences on the court!

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.660
Bi-Binbouda?

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.410
That God of Misfortune?

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.000
What's with that damn gorilla?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.420
His name is Gorihara!

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:40.590
He's in the tennis club with me, and has been my rival since middle school.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.720
One merely has to mention the names
Technician Adenokouji and Crasher Gorihara

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.390
and people all across the country will recognize our famous rivalry, one that's already...

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:49.510
Well, I don't really care about all that.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.770
What? No way!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.730
If you win against her, you can have a whole year's worth of bananas!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:55.940
Very good!

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:59.020
If I'm against that beggar bitch,
I don't have to hold anything back!

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:02.360
Today's the day I wipe that cocky look off your face!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:06.780
It's insulting that a worthless bum like yourself would even dare to stand before me.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.370
Little girl, I'll have you know...

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.200
That I... Um... Well...

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.540
Goddamn it!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:16.330
Wow, you two are really getting into it! Have fun, guys!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.040
A normal match would be no fun at all, though.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:23.050
How about putting something on the line?
Wouldn't that be more exciting?

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:24.550
You're on!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:28.640
If I win, this time you'll finally have to get out of my sight forever!

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.470
Sounds good to me.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:35.350
And if you lose, you'll have to give up your Fortune like a good girl.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.230
Will you two make a wager?

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.190
A wager? How fascinating. Then...

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:47.780
We're prepared to bet anything, even our hair! That is to say, the Prince will.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.620
What?! You're joking, right?

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:52.160
That unthinkable thing you just said was a joke, right?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.080
Don't underestimate the Prince's resolve!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.250
Right back at ya! If we lose,

00:05:56.250 --> 00:06:00.920
Gorihara will spend a week in a cage with a female gorilla in heat!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.590
Will he still have his innocence by the end?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.420
We're puttin' it all on the line!

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.930
<i>This is a fight I can't afford to lose.</i>

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:17.810
I've only played a little bit of tennis before, but I'm sure I'd still outmatch that hobo any day.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.730
That just leaves Bigfoot's long-lost relative...

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.360
That gorilla's amazing.

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:31.780
You damn gorilla!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.200
What d'you think you're doing to Sakura?!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.240
You bastard!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.410
Silence!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.580
This is a tennis match, not some brawl!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.250
Those who are unable to understand this should leave us!

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.290
And besides...

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:49.510
Should you not concern yourself more with
Sakura's wellbeing than Gorihara's wrongdoing?

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.510
Prince...

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.140
That's right.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:57.270
Those who are shamed on the court
can only regain their honor on the court!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:07:00.190
Sakura! I'm glad you understand!

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.270
Here comes the next one.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.990
Are you okay, Gorihara?!

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.120
Hey.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:14.780
Huh?

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:19.040
Pull something like that again and I'll fuckin' kill you!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.540
Not bad, Ichiko!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.500
S-She seems reliable.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:27.510
Now it's my turn!

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:29.800
I can't match Gorihara in power,

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.220
but try my Phantom Serve!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.470
If you can see it, that is!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.230
Oh! What an amazing transformation!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.310
What?

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.400
Gum-Gum...

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.070
Receive!

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.820
Hey, ref! Stretchy limbs are against the rules!

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.740
<i>That's</i> the part that bothers her?!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.990
What's with those two?

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:59.500
Anyway, aside from Gorihara's mortal fear of Ichiko

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.000
and Adenokouji's stunned disbelief of Momiji,

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.460
the match continued on as swimmingly as anyone could expect,

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:09.000
and we finally arrived at the last set.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.220
Binbouda!

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:11.970
Huh?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:16.640
Your foolish tricks may have dumbfounded me at first, but I've grown accustomed to them!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.930
Your ridiculous antics will end here!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.600
You think you have me figured out?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:26.230
I'll show you the kind of tricks I <i>really</i> have up my sleeve!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.320
<i>What could she be doing?</i>

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.740
<i>It almost looks like there are multiple Binboudas!</i>

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:37.410
<i>Could she be moving quickly enough to leave after-images?</i>

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.620
<i>You truly amaze me, Binbouda Momiji!</i>

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.370
<i>Pull yourself together, Adenokouji Shion!</i>

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.080
<i>See through the illusion!</i>

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.290
<i>Only one of those balls is real!</i>

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.000
And it's... this one!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:54.800
I did not expect after-images to have mass...

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.180
Yes!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.430
Not bad, Momiji!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:01.180
Those aren't after-images, they're actual copies of her!

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.520
Prince, are you okay?

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:09.270
I'm done for. Please, go on without me.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.690
Get a hold of yourself, Prince!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:14.360
Sakura... I leave the rest to you.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.490
All I ask...

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.450
is that you spare my hair.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.370
Prince!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.580
I'll get you for that!

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.420
Time out! I'm getting my special racket!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.920
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:34.970
Now hold on a minute... Your special racket?

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.180
That's just the Soumin Shourai!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.600
Here I go!

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.140
What are you doing?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:44.770
What do you think's gonna happen if you use that in front of everyone?

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.850
Whoa, what's with this sudden gale?!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:47.560
Oww!

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.150
There's sand in my eyes! I can't see!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.900
Fortune sure is convenient.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.610
But isn't this a bit much?

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.120
Ichiko! Momiji!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.120
I will avenge the Prince.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.750
I'm not dead!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.830
Eat this!

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:14.420
Man, these guys are always such a pain to deal with...

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:15.840
That said...

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.300
I hate running away!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.760
Who was left behind?!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.560
Cow-Tits, No-Tits, Prince and Gorilla!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.100
You made that really easy to understand.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.810
Anyway, you guys back away!

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:33.230
What the hell was that?!

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:38.200
What's going on inside that massive storm?

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:48.040
Isn't this supposed to be tennis?!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.470
Is class over already?

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.430
Did the court fly away?!

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.350
Uh...

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:10.270
Due to the unscheduled relocation of our court, tennis is postponed!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.440
I'm not gonna let this end in a tie!

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.980
The match isn't over till one of us is dead!

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.030
You guys sure are lively!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.490
Thus, the match was declared a tie.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:24.990
The two boys got out of their wager, but...

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.370
I got that Sakura mochi you like!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.540
Here are some Hiroshima Momiji steamed buns from my trip!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:33.630
Momiji scary!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:38.260
And that's how the two boys developed a very specific form of gynophobia.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.550
Wonderful! Wonderful!

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.010
In what way?!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:49.060
This week's <i>Nadeshiko ga!</i>

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.520
Saved you the search!

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.020
I finally did it!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:06.280
Is that so? If you insist...

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:10.830
Very well. I'll take care of the paperwork.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:14.120
I'll leave the rest to your own judgment.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.290
Please ascertain the situation with your own eyes.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:23.510
All right!

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:28.930
I've put it off 'til now, but today's the day I finally try it!

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.180
Cooking!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.190
Suwano!

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:39.020
<i>Miss Ichiko, instead of living on takeout and convenience store food, I hope you will cook for yourself.</i>

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:44.110
<i>And don't forget to eat three square meals a day!</i>

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:49.240
<i>Don't worry! I can do it if I try!</i>

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:54.500
<i>I'm just a beginner, so it's not like I could cook like you at the drop of a hat,</i>

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:55.370
<i>but I can imagine how nice it would feel to have everyone eat my cooking and enjoy it.</i>

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:59.960
Yum!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:04.430
Wait, what? Why the hell was I thinking of Tsuwabuki?!

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.760
All right, let's do this!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:11.470
Firstly, it says to put on the rice before doing anythi—

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.270
The boss was fired.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.560
Who are you, Darvish?!

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:20.690
<i>If only I'd won that tennis match, I'd be rid of her forever!</i>

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:25.360
<i>I shouldn't have gotten so riled up.</i>

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:27.360
Well, whatever.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.660
Nothing like cooking to take your mind off things!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:30.950
Let's do this!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.010
<i>How could all this happen in just two minutes?</i>

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.130
<i>If she were here, she'd definitely give me crap about it.</i>

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:47.510
There's no way that could happen in just two minutes!

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:51.180
All right! I give up!

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:55.560
Sorry for the wait! Pizza delivery!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.560
Thank you very much!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:58.690
Thanks!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.570
Gonna start cooking tomorrow instead, a pizza pizza!

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:03.440
Gonna—

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:05.940
This is great!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:08.990
Don't just help yourself to my dinner!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.870
You can spare a little bit, right?

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:13.790
I haven't had a thing to eat since yesterday!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:18.210
And... It's such a shame, but...

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.670
How the hell did this happen in two minutes?!

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:22.960
Shut your trap!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:27.050
I don't need <i>you</i> to point that out! Just give me my goddamn pizza!

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:34.930
Gaah! The hot, sticky cheese is all over my beautiful face!

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.230
Whoa, are you all right?

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.650
Actually, this is pretty good.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.360
Get out!

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:48.070
I miss Suwano's cooking.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.290
I only heard a few rumors of it back home,

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.960
but you really are havin' a bloody hard time of it, eh?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.130
Been a while, Momiji.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.550
Oh? You're...

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.050
Kuroyuri?

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.180
What're you doing here in the human world?

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.390
They sent me here as yer backup.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:15.140
My backup?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.430
It's all thanks to our friendship, yeah?

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:20.230
I suggested it to ol' Yamabuki.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:26.150
"An old mate of mine's in a real pickle," I said. "I'm the only one who can help her, y'know?"

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:30.490
Yamabuki thought that was fair enough, y'know?

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:34.490
Said we should combine our powers to
complete the mission and stuff like that.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:37.910
That 'bout sums it up. Let's give it our best shot, yeah?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:43.040
<i>'Course, I didn't come here to help you at all.</i>

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.960
<i>All I gotta do is grab Sakura Ichiko's Fortune for myself and I'll be outta here like a rat up a drainpipe.</i>

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.880
<i>Then all the credit will be mine!</i>

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:52.260
<i>Once I do that, Yamabuki will definitely...</i>

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:54.850
You're so wonderful, Kuroyuri!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.100
All in a day's work, y'know?

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:04.520
Get out of it, ya slimy bint!

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:08.980
You haven't changed a bit, Kuroyuri!

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.530
You seem a bit out of shape, Yuririn.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.660
Don't call me that! I'll kick yer arse from here to Timbuctoo!

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.990
<i>Goddamn it, makin' a fool outta me!</i>

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.830
<i>That good-for-nothing lazy-arse bumfuck bludger! She does my head in!</i>

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.880
<i>And to think Sister Yamabuki likes her!</i>

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.380
<i>I'll fuckin' kill ya! I'll fuckin' kill ya!</i>

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:31.670
I see you're still getting worked up over our so-called "rivalry". How tiresome.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:39.600
But I'm glad to hear you were concerned enough about me to come all the way here. Much appreciated.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.350
Hah, steady on.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.350
We're friends, yeah?

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.900
All right! All done!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.650
So I <i>can</i> do it if I try!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.610
Now, as long as she keeps her nose out of this...

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.490
Excuse me!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.570
Get out, you God of Plague!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:58.950
I told you I'm a God of Misfortune!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:00.290
Oh? What's this?

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:04.410
Could it be another God of Misfortune right behind you?

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:07.710
So, this here's Sakura Ichiko?

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.880
She sure does look like she's never suffered a day in her life.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:15.720
Who's that? Friend of yours?

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.760
I guess you could say that.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:19.720
You could say...

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:22.140
...we're allies!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:25.480
For duty!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.440
Bloody hell!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:31.690
Oh, no! It broke!

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:34.950
You bitch... Momiji!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:45.500
Oh, I forgot I had an experimental cake in the oven.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:49.080
Being able to make a cake explode is rather impressive.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.710
Goddamnit!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.170
Toady!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:56.010
You think you can make a fool outta me?!

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:59.390
Now I don't even give a shit who's involved!

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.970
I'll turn ya all to ash!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:05.180
Gadget of Misfortune: Old Man Nosey!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:10.770
Nicknamed "Pochi," it burns everything in a one kilometer radius to a crisp!

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:17.150
Ugh, it stinks! What the hell is that?!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.490
You distracted me and the stew got burned!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.410
That's more than just burnt!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:27.330
But don't just toss it, you tosser!
There are starvin' people in Africa!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:32.000
This is horrible... it's even worse than the rotting corpses of Hell!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:36.090
Get off my back! It's not like you can cook either, right?

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.880
What are you saying? I'm...

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.550
That's right.

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:42.470
This is my chance.

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:46.480
Want to have a cooking match to settle the score from our tennis match?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.690
Of course, you'd wager your Fortune.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.480
A-All right, then!

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:55.400
And if I win, you have to leave the human world for good!

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.440
H-Huh? Hold up a sec...

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:59.240
Are you serious?

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:03.490
I was half joking, but where are <i>you</i> getting all that baseless confidence from?

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.660
I'm skilled when I need to be!

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:10.250
Real skills come from practice and experience. You've had no experience at all!

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:11.790
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:13.340
You there!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.040
Huh?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:16.050
You be the judge.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.380
What? Why me?!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:20.930
Name your favorite food, Kuroyuri.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:25.010
Let's find out who can match your taste, right here and now.

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:29.520
Huh? I s'pose... Meat and potato stew?

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:34.610
<i>Why am I...?</i>

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:39.190
<i>Your competitive nature will be your undoing, Ichiko!</i>

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:43.820
<i>No matter how much Fortune you possess, it won't help you become a master chef overnight!</i>

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.790
<i>And cooking is my specialty!</i>

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.210
<i>I've got this one in the bag.</i>

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:55.590
It's done! Feast your eyes on this!

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.340
Huh? Meat and potato stew?

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.010
Done!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.100
The hell is that?

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.350
It's obviously meat and potato stew.

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.560
It's obviously darker than black.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:15.810
If you look at it just right, it's like a face cryin' out in agony...

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.440
Stop blabbering and judge it already!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:21.610
Judge? To start with, this sure as hell isn't meat and potato stew.

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:24.530
I reckon it's not even food at all!

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:25.740
Listen here.

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:30.120
What's important in human cooking isn't the appearance. It's the content!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:33.170
So basically, you're a failure as a human.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.080
So this is it.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:37.670
Okay. She'll be right.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.090
I'll just have a little taste,

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:41.550
and declare her the loser.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:51.100
Fuck me!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:21.800
Did she just vomit her own guts out?

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.550
How rude!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:27.300
So what do we do now? What about the competition?

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:28.760
You cooked it, you eat it.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:32.470
Nope. I don't want to die just yet.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:33.560
You...

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.560
Now then, will you tell me in detail?

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.520
How is Momiji faring in the human world?

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.030
What's your own assessment?

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:46.780
There's no way I could ever take down Sakura Ichiko!

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:49.620
But don't worry! Momiji's doin' a great job!

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.080
Does she have PTSD??

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:55.750
I'll start cooking tomorrow. For real.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:56.960
This is so good!

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:30.760
I can't stop laughing!
